## Key Services

### App Service
- Web applications
- API backends
- Container apps

### Azure SQL Database
- Managed SQL Server
- Auto-scaling
- Geo-replication

### Cosmos DB
- NoSQL database
- Global distribution
- Multiple APIs (SQL, MongoDB, etc.)

### Key Vault
- Secret management
- Certificate storage
- Encryption keys

### Storage Account
- Blob storage
- File shares
- Queue storage

---

## Deployment

```bash
# Login
az login

# Create resource group
az group create --name rg-myapp-dev --location eastus

# Deploy Bicep template
az deployment group create \
  --resource-group rg-myapp-dev \
  --template-file main.bicep \
  --parameters environmentName=dev
```

---

## Security Best Practices

✅ Use Managed Identities (no credentials in code)  
✅ Store secrets in Key Vault  
✅ Enable Azure Defender  
✅ Use Private Endpoints  
✅ Implement RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)

---

## Success Metrics

- ✅ All infrastructure defined in Bicep
- ✅ No hardcoded secrets
- ✅ Managed Identities used
- ✅ Resources properly tagged
- ✅ Cost monitoring enabled
